Lungfish Primer Design Adapter v1

This adapter interoperates with, but is not part of, the upstream Olivar and
varVAMP projects. It preserves their original native outputs and records their
separate versions and source hashes. Lungfish's Olivar final-pair guard is an
app-owned, version-locked adaptation applied in memory to the verified Olivar
1.3.3 pair-list construction before SADDLE optimization.

